Cyberpunk style: A sprawling neon-lit digital cityscape at night where towering crystalline data structures rise from a grid-patterned floor, each building representing nested folders and directories. Electric blue and magenta light pulses through transparent pathways connecting the structures like neural networks. In the foreground, a massive holographic tree with branching fractal patterns grows upward, its roots spreading into the glowing grid below while its branches subdivide infinitely into smaller illuminated nodes. The scene has rain-slicked surfaces reflecting the cybernetic glow, with floating geometric particles drifting through the air. The architecture follows a clear hierarchical pattern—larger monolithic structures at the base splitting into progressively smaller connected units toward the top, creating a visual metaphor of organized digital architecture evolving in complexity. Dark atmospheric fog rolls between structures, punctuated by streaks of data-light racing through transparent conduits.
